  "protocolVersion": null,
  "instructions": "mcp-osrs answers Old School RuneScape questions in one call.\n\nTool groups:\n- Account: set_account saves the player's name and mode (main, ironman, hardcore_ironman, ultimate_ironman, deadman, seasonal); lookup_player reads hiscores; get_player_progress reads WikiSync.\n- Wiki: search, read pages and sections, and query structured wiki data.\n- GE: live prices, margins after GE tax, and price history.\n- Items, Monsters, Quests, Achievements, Skills and Clues: game facts checked against the saved account.\n\nPersonal answers: call set_account once and later answers are checked against that account, with ironman accounts getting ironman quest data and no GE. A player argument overrides the saved account for one call. Quest, diary and collection-log checks need the WikiSync RuneLite plugin; without it they show \"?\".\n\nLarge answers are paged: pass the returned cursor to continue.\n\nAttribution: wiki content is CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 from the Old School RuneScape Wiki (answers link their sources); quest data comes from Quest Helper (BSD 2-Clause).",
  "durationMs": 7487,
